From: Brett Heap <1513478+brettheap@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:29:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] The assembly root's front door resolves the split's
 collisions: AGENTS.md opens with the shape's pointer and a short map of the
 three repositories, README.md gains them and the lockstep invariant, and
 every path that crossed into a leg names that leg.

Rehearsal patch for opensoft/openRepoTools#186, task T006 of
specs/004-migrate-to-triad/tasks.md, against run C's rehearsed split
69b8924. Nothing under shape/ and no file with a row in
contracts/shape-pin.yaml is touched.

- AGENTS.md: line 1 is the exact pointer that openRepoShape 7f84ca4's
  SHAPE_POINTER_LINE and its adopt follow-up require. A seven-entry map
  follows: spec, code, this root, the tests, the lane tooling's code and
  manual, paired feature worktrees, and the local-rehearsal file-transport
  flag. The original AGENTS.md comes after it, unchanged except for 16 path
  repairs (docs/ -> spec/docs/, openspec/ -> spec/openspec/, and upstream/,
  contracts/, tests/ and .github/ -> code/...). 316 -> 340 lines.
- README.md: a "Three repositories" section and "The lockstep invariant",
  which contracts/{spec,code}-pin.yaml's `resync_runbook:
  README.md#the-lockstep-invariant` names and which only shape/README.md
  carried. The install section now says the one-liner is unchanged and that
  the installer is code/openRepoTools. 12 path repairs, and the pin-bump
  block re-rooted with `cd code`. 486 -> 510 lines.
- .gitignore: the shape's `.venv/` and `.DS_Store` merged in, and
  `/worktrees/`, the line the three-leg bootstrap requires.
- .gitattributes: the same `* text=auto eol=lf` rule, re-explained for this
  root's pinned copies. The installer reason moved with its files to
  code/.gitattributes.
- CLAUDE.md is unchanged: "Read AGENTS.md." is byte-identical to the
  shape's own rendered shape/CLAUDE.md.

The two length caps in code/tests/test_repo_hygiene.py, 316 and 486, are
today's counts. Once T009 points those tests at the assembly root, each cap
is raised in a dated entry naming the rule its lines bought.

Lane: openRepoTools-1
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
